    "both sides judge the SAME inputs against the SAME expectation. A divergence on",
    "any row makes one of the two sides red.",
    "",
    "value_kind: 'json_array' -> the shared layer sees Value::Json(Array), the host sees",
    "the plain JS array. 'string' -> the shared layer sees Value::String, the host sees",
    "the plain JS string."
